silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_sections_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'CannonOrGptAbsorptionConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the governed Mittens individual at Tartu Animal Clinic annual vet exam 2026-05-18 — the concrete cat whose storage-identity distinction grounds all Granite specs; also, Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a: Tartu vet-record payload, sha256:7f4a...bf2c, evidence leg typed, back-pointer to src/papers/05_granite_substrate/sections/02_mittens_anchor.tex; also, clinical care plan record 77 at Tartu clinic, receives universal-mediator from Mittens apex but not from GraniteRow — concrete proof of strict Hom-profile inclusion." .
